{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a highly immersive 3D open-world action game. Players will control a uniquely designed white monster to freely explore the map. The game uses a third-person perspective, allowing players to experience the monster's adventure in a vivid and immersive way. The health system in the upper-left corner reminds players to be wary of dangers in the environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster can nimbly shuttle through diverse scenes: from moving through lush forests to exploring secrets in ruined buildings, every location is filled with the joy of exploration. The rich map design, combined with delicate 3D modeling, constructs an open world brimming with life and crisis.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#### **Gameplay**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free exploration and evasion game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can manipulate the character to freely tour the map without any tasks! However, please pay attention to avoiding monsters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a monster touches the player, the player will lose part of their health points. When the player's health points are reduced to zero, they will die.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#### **Controls**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement = WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790240?t=1750748011","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790240?t=1750748011","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790240/6a4edee503b98fff82298dedd65e916ddcb8bb5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750748011","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790240/6a4edee503b98fff82298dedd65e916ddcb8bb5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750748011","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a highly immersive 3D open-world action game. Players will control a uniquely designed white monster to freely explore the map. The game uses a third-person perspective, allowing players to experience the monster's adventure in a vivid and immersive way. The health system in the upper-left corner reminds players to be wary of dangers in the environment.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monster can nimbly shuttle through diverse scenes: from moving through lush forests to exploring secrets in ruined buildings, every location is filled with the joy of exploration. The rich map design, combined with delicate 3D modeling, constructs an open world brimming with life and crisis.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#### **Gameplay**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a free exploration and evasion game.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players can manipulate the character to freely tour the map without any tasks! However, please pay attention to avoiding monsters.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When a monster touches the player, the player will lose part of their health points. When the player's health points are reduced to zero, they will die.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >#### **Controls**  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Movement = WASD</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Chen Min"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790240/a26f6041669749a6abfca73bb8c794d31df7be11/header.jpg?t=1750748011","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3790240/1790832168/883e0f3c0a5cbd068ac2a8578e9b871c2faf6484/1750377028/dash_av1.mpd?t=1749536663","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3790240/1790832168/883e0f3c0a5cbd068ac2a8578e9b871c2f